WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:08.040
It has been such a joy to pray together with you over these 40

2
00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:08.400
days.

3
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.059
I hope it's been a blessing and encouragement to you.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.620
Let's pray together over day 40.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.220
Father, thank you

6
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:22.060
for the assurance that you can do more with sin in our lives

7
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.060
than just forgive it.

8
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.900
You can break its power. It is true, you break the

9
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.080
power of canceled sin,

10
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.500
and you set the prisoner free.

11
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.620
And we thank you, Lord, that the foulness of our nature is

12
00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.560
not left out of the redemption that we can experience in this

13
00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.140
world. We have the fruits of heaven a little early,

14
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.720
and we thank you.

15
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.200
We pray, Lord, that you would look down upon our hearts and our minds,

16
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.240
and that if this friend that I'm praying with today,

17
00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:00.080
if they know the assurance that they're filled with the Holy Spirit,

18
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.700
then let them live continually in that assurance until the

19
00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.170
day comes when you take them home.

20
00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:11.060
And if they don't, then Lord, we pray that the

21
00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:14.280
claws of the lion would go deep into our hearts

22
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.300
and that you would let it cost ever so much and hurt

23
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.260
ever so much.

24
00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:22.960
But whatever it takes,

25
00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.140
whatever pain, whatever sacrifice,

26
00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.060
whatever loss, whatever giving up, whatever surrender,

27
00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:35.700
that you would change us in ways that we can never change

28
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.300
ourselves.

29
00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.080
We know that we cannot discipline the nature of sin

30
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.920
out of ourselves. It's going to have to be a work of God.

31
00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.580
We didn't put it there. We can't take it away.

32
00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.100
But we believe that you are strong enough to do exactly

33
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.000
that. So Lord, help the claws of the lion to go as

34
00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:00.980
deep as necessary to transform us today, tomorrow,

35
00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:05.280
and for always. We pray in the good and powerful and mighty name

36
00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.730
of Jesus, our Savior, the one who provided our

37
00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:09.330
holiness,

38
00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:14.260
and the Lion of the tribe of Judah, who is our sanctifier.

39
00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.260
We praise you, and we rejoice in what you've done for us in these 40 days.

40
00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:23.260
Now, we ask, Lord, that you would accept our gratitude and help us live in

41
00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.760
light of what you've done. In Christ's name. Amen.

42
00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.500
I'd encourage you to continue seeking the Lord together for these few minutes

43
00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.900
and always. May the Lord bless you.
